<title>HONG KONG: Bank Negara HK branch places $45 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara HK branch places $45 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A US$45 million floating rate certificates of deposit issue for Bank Negara Indonesia's Hongkong branch has been privately placed, said arranger LTCB Asia on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The certificates have a maturity of three years. Fees are not disclosed. Denominations are US$500,000.</p>
<p>The payment date is May 23.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
